 Sweep, Hammer, Zipper, Button-rub\n\n4. Human-Related Sounds\n- Speech, Laugh, Cry, Cough, Sneeze, Breath, Whisper, Shout, Cheer, Sigh, Burp, Swallow, Clap, Stamp, Whistle, Hum\n\n5. Mechanical & Electronic Sounds\n- Alarm, Phone-vibrate, Current, Printer, Scanner, Hairdryer, Vacuum, Washing-machine, TV-on, Computer-boot, Camera-shutter, Recorder-button, Doorbell, Siren, Oven-beep\n\n6. Special Scene Sounds\n- Fire-crackle, Firework, Firecracker, Glass-shatter, Metal-clink, Water-spray, Bubble-pop, Gear-turn, Rope-rub, Horse-hoof, Wheel-roll, Plane-takeoff, Train-horn, Ship-whistle, Gunshot, Explosion, Piano, Guitar, Drum, Violin\n\nFood Making \n- Slice, Dice, Chop, Stir-fry, Fry, Simmer, Steam, Bake, Blend, Grind, Juice, Strain, Brew, Boil, Bubble, Crisp, Crunch, Chew, Bag-tear, Can-open, Oil-pour, Powder-sprinkle, Meat-chop, Peel, Pit, Dough-knead, Roll, Ferment, Roast, Oven-out, Cool, Plate\n\nOutdoor Adventure \n- Hiking-stick-tap, Gravel-rub, Branch-snap, Breath, Wind, Birdsong, Stream, Waterfall, Leaf-fall, Snow-crunch, Ice-crack, Campfire-crackle, Tent-zipper, Backpack-rub, Water-bottle-pour, Map-flip, Compass-spin, Mosquito-hum, Animal-howl, Thunder, Rain, Hail, Mist-drop, Grass-step, Rock-step, Mud-step, Rope-rub, Climb-tap\n\nWorkplace Office \n- Typing, Mouse-click, Keyboard-tap, Page-turn, Paper-tear, Staple, Bind, Print, Scan, Copy, Phone-ring, Call, Whisper, Cough, Footstep, Door-open, Door-close, Elevator-run, AC-hum, Water-dispenser, Coffee-brew, Pen-write, Eraser, File-stack, Drawer-open, Drawer-close, Meeting-vote, Applause, Projector-on, Mic-static\n\nHome Daily Life\n- Wake-up, Dress, Groom, Brush-teeth, Wash-face, Comb-hair, Hairdryer, Shaver, Water-flow, Toilet-flush, Cook, Dish-wash, Mop, Sweep, Vacuum, Table-wipe, Clothes-organize, Fold, Zipper, Button, Door-open, Door-close, TV-on, Remote-click, Phone-vibrate, Alarm, Microwave-beep, Fridge-hum, Washing-machine-run, Hang-clothes, Collect-clothes, Scissor-cut, Tape-stick\n\nSports & Fitness 